   |         ---------- required by a bound introduced by this call
...
37 | /         make_a_ball.output_distribution(move |paint: Paint| {
38 | |             Distribution::new().to(red, Ball(paint.0))
39 | |         }),
   | |__________^ this body cannot be called with what `(TakeEdge<Paint>,)` produces
